   "source": [
    "**🔹 Part 1: Data Import & Preparation (5 Points)**\n",
    "Load the full 2023 Yellow Taxi dataset and:\n",
    "\n",
    "Keep only valid trips:\n",
    "\n",
    "trip_distance > 0\n",
    "\n",
    "total_amount > 0\n",
    "\n",
    "Derive:\n",
    "\n",
    "trip_duration_minutes (dropoff − pickup)\n",
    "\n",
    "fare_per_mile = total_amount / trip_distance\n",
    "\n",
    "month as factor (1–12)\n",
    "\n",
    "Select 2 continuous variables for modeling:\n",
    "\n",
    "Required: trip_distance vs total_amount"
   ]
  },
