   "source": [
    "**🔹 Part 4: Robust Regression & Influence (7 Points)**\n",
    "Large urban datasets contain extreme values.\n",
    "\n",
    "Required:\n",
    "Detect influential observations:\n",
    "\n",
    "Cook’s distance, leverage, or standardized residuals\n",
    "\n",
    "List 10 most influential trips\n",
    "\n",
    "Fit a robust regression model (e.g., Huber)\n",
    "\n",
    "Compare:\n",
    "\n",
    "Coefficients\n",
    "\n",
    "Predictions at high distances\n",
    "\n",
    "Explain effect of outliers"
   ]
